terskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3075\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E4%B8%9D%E7%BB%92\" title=\"沙丝绒\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E4%B8%9D%E7%BB%92\" title=\"沙丝绒\"><img alt=\"沙丝绒\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-307501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/4/46/HeadIconSmall-307501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B2%99%E4%B8%9D%E7%BB%92\" title=\"沙丝绒\">沙丝绒</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>1.9</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>点唱机</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>新世界的风</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：307503</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">一本有明显使用痕迹的便签本，里面夹满了小票、收据与优惠券。<br /><b><i>“攒到钱后要做的事情！”</i></b><br />①袋鼠岛的旅行<br />我需要休息，休息，充足的休息！我要尽快忘掉速食店的后厨——那些被洒得到处都是的酱料，以及永远洗不完的盘子！<br />②乘坐热气球<br />说真的，我早就想看看这个地方是什么样的。多奇妙啊，我每天在这座城市里穿梭，到处找活干，但始终没正眼瞧过它——在热气球上，也许我就能看见它！<br />备注：当然，别忘了波拉比！</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"307503\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307504.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cb/Belonging-307504.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“勇敢之旅”牛仔帽<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Brave Adventurer\" Cowboy Hat</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />3.87<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一顶被冠以“勇敢者”之名的牛仔帽。手工缝线的粗糙感和强烈的撞色搭配令人头晕目眩。<br />“也许我不懂艺术，但你也一定不懂‘性价比’～”受访者相当自豪。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307505.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/f/f9/Belonging-307505.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“野性之火”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\"> Digipet \"Wildfire\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>电子宠物机“宠相随”系列限定款，受访者坚称，它绝不止外表看上去那般普通。“对，仔细看好，准备，准备——”<br />“吱～吱吱——！”<br />……必须承认，它确实让我大吃一惊。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-307506.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5b/Belonging-307506.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">野营“全家桶”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">Camper Gear Set</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在数家街边折扣店之中、经由层层选拔而购入的优秀远足用品，从攀山绳索到营造气氛用的户外装饰一应俱全。<br />由于选拔过程过于漫长，它们的实际购入价格早已无法确认，受访者唯一能够肯定的是“它们一定划算得令你难以置信”。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 野性的倾洒1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b2/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%921.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 野性的倾洒2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E9%87%8E%E6%80%A7%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BE%E6%B4%922.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">野性的倾洒 <small style=\"color: grey\">Call of the Wild</small></span></span>"}}